{"title": "Rejuvenating Miasma (Condition)", "pageid": 31814, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Rejuvenating_Miasma_(Condition)", "categories": ["No status groups", "Has tick type", "No stack type", "No stack priority", "No status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Glutted_Catacombs_(Condition)\" title=\"Glutted Catacombs (Condition)\">Glutted Catacombs (Condition)</a>        </div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Death Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Rejuvenating Miasma</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead\" title=\"Animate Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/38px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/50px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animate Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Animate_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Animate_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead\" title=\"Animate Dead\">Animate Dead</a> doesn't require a corpse in this area due to a lingering necrotic stench. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ANIMATEDEAD_ZONE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ANIMATEDEAD_ZONE+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ANIMATEDEAD_ZONE+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ANIMATEDEAD_ZONE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CANIMATEDEAD_ZONE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CANIMATEDEAD_ZONE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: N/A</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Rejuvenating_Miasma\">Sources of Rejuvenating Miasma</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Passively affects creatures in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a><sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"creatures or party member...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition is similar to but not the same as the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glutted_Catacombs_(Condition)\" title=\"Glutted Catacombs (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glutted Catacombs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glutted_Catacombs_(Condition)\" title=\"Glutted Catacombs (Condition)\">Glutted Catacombs</a> condition in the <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Mausoleum\" title=\"Grand Mausoleum\">Grand Mausoleum</a>.</li>\n<li>This also applies to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fungal_Infestation\" title=\"Fungal Infestation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Fungal_Infestation_Icon.webp/25px-Fungal_Infestation_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Fungal_Infestation_Icon.webp/38px-Fungal_Infestation_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Fungal_Infestation_Icon.webp/50px-Fungal_Infestation_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fungal Infestation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Fungal_Infestation_Icon.webp/25px-Fungal_Infestation_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Fungal_Infestation_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fungal_Infestation\" title=\"Fungal Infestation\">Fungal Infestation</a> ability from the <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_Spores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Circle of Spores\">Circle of Spores</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a> subclass, allowing the creation of Fungal Zombies without a corpse.</li>\n<li>Due to the presence of a <a href=\"/wiki/Restoration\" title=\"Restoration\">Restoration</a> device in this area, which will fully recharge the resources needed to use either Animate Dead or Fungal Infestation, a theoretically unbounded number of undead followers can be created (except on <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>, where each Restoration device can only be used once).</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715015313\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1912/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20626/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8976/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1352346/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.162      1 -total\n 98.48%   53.340      1 Template:Condition_page\n 45.51%   24.651      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 18.35%    9.938      1 Template:PageSeo\n 17.68%    9.574      5 Template:Icon_link\n 16.61%    8.995      5 Template:Icon_text\n 15.24%    8.255     20 Template:Trim\n 13.94%    7.549      4 Template:Template_style\n 13.67%  